Package: ds-linux-balance-pet
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, fonts-noto-cjk, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xwayland
Description: lightweight DeepSeek balance desktop pet for Linux
 An unofficial Linux desktop pet focused on the DeepSeek account balance.
 It uses GTK3 and Cairo, supports a compact animated mode with a small set
 of dsh-pet animations and a classic mode with 19 static character looks.
 The balance is read directly from the DeepSeek /user/balance endpoint.
 .
 The application is designed for X11 or XWayland sessions. It does not
 enable login autostart by default and does not include an MCP server.
